# scripts/verify-versions-pin.sh (a pre-commit hook) enforces it. Resolved
# empirically on scar.lab; re-verify before trusting if this file is more
# than a few weeks old -- this ecosystem moves fast (see
# plan-radiance-vllm.md §5).

# --- Primary image (vllm-radiance / libr4d) ---------------------------------
# Resolved 2026-09-14. magiccodingman's fork chosen over the canonical
# stilldeadcode/vllm-radiance repo (stale at resolution time, ~3 weeks
# since last push) -- see plan §4.1/§5 and .env-template's comment.
